        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5121C, Cortina Key in Lever with Rectangular Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Cortina Key in Lever with Rectangular Rose has just enough modern flair to bring this other wise traditional leverset into the contemporary. This lovely Keyed Cortina Lever with Rectangular Rosette is perfect for transitional homes as well as farm-styles homes, or historic-looking new builds. Emtek's Cortina Lever with Rectangular Rose is a great way to add extra security to your doors--making it the perfect way to lock your office or closet. The keyed entry is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior while a dummy lever is just for looks and does not latch nor lock. This drop-tail door lever will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/cortina-lever-with-rectangular-rose-emtek-8521c\"><b>Cortina Lever with Rectangular Rose</b></a> for interior doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Emtek Cortina Lever with Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Clearance: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, keys, door latch, and strike plate.\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
